    "original_gold_lex_dicts": {
        "Id1": {
            "text": "The popular 1956 film, It's Great to Be Young, starred English actors John Mills and Cecil Parker, and was directed by Cyril Frankel. Cinematography was by Gilbert Taylor, with composition for the musical comedy by Louis Levy. The film's running time is 94 minutes, and, according to the Historical Journal of Film, Radio and Television, was produced for 282,838 pounds."
        },
        "Id2": {
            "text": "John Mills and Cecil Parker star in the movie It\u2019s Great to be Young which was released in 1956. Gilbert Taylor was the cinematographer and the movie last for 94 minutes. Louis Levy composed the music. Cyril Frankel directed the movie and helped get the movie 282,838 pounds during box office."
        },
