            "text": "It\u2019s Great to be Young is a 1956 movie that last for 94 minutes. It is starring Cecil Parker and John Mills. Gilbert Taylor is the cinematographer and the director is Cyril Frankel. It made 282,838 pounds in income. Louis Levy composed the music."
